// 3. patch embed: Linear$(16 → d)$ + learned position
// 4. per-channel time TransformerEncoder (2 layers, 4 heads, d=128)
// 5. flatten patches per channel → tokens of size $P\cdot d$, run MHA + FFN across variables
// 6. final Linear head $(P\cdot d → \mathrm{pred\_len})$, transpose back, RevIN-denormalize

